{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898410/extras/6fc224a94d1dc01a434c4c58ab7e1762.poster.avif?t=1754248001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898410/extras/6fc224a94d1dc01a434c4c58ab7e1762.webm?t=1754248001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Gooner Demo takes a more erotic, goon-pilled approach to a classic MMO-style, combined with a turn-based strategy game. Fuck sex-starved Goonettes to claim &quot;NUTS&quot; and experience points, which allow you to acquire more abilities and items at shrines. Gather as much potential and utility as possible, as you'll certainly need it to defeat the Slime Queen and see the rest of the content this Demo has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898410/extras/7a79b63a65d315c036f9c7f7c62abdd0.poster.avif?t=1754248001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898410/extras/7a79b63a65d315c036f9c7f7c62abdd0.webm?t=1754248001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While the full game has an interesting and unique story line along with a much wider array of unique encounters, the Gooner Demo focusses more closely on base gameplay mechanics. This can help familiarize yourself with the general feel of the game, along with experiencing the type of content you can expect from the full game. Also while the full game will have a minimum of three bosses per general location, the demo showcases just one in order to give just a small taste of what exciting mechanics each unique boss encounter will throw at you in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898410/extras/ada3f8729c78e52e1f6d7b4e870b47a6.poster.avif?t=1754248001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898410/extras/ada3f8729c78e52e1f6d7b4e870b47a6.webm?t=1754248001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An important detail to become familiar with  would be the Shrine. Shrines are locations found all over the full game, and twice in the Gooner Demo, that play a huge role in the gameplay loop. Gooners can rest at these sites, as well as purchase goods from the merchant, acquire new abilities, or even fast travel. It's also important to keep in mind  that all previously defeated non-boss encounters will be respawned  after visiting a shrine.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898410/extras/462d29af203514fe2204ba5ab396f673.poster.avif?t=1754248001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898410/extras/462d29af203514fe2204ba5ab396f673.webm?t=1754248001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Gooner Demo is always available at your convenience.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3898410?t=1754248001","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3898410?t=1754248001","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898410/a3dabb5b3115808dcc09e0eef2dfeef58b736198/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754248001","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.aka